docs {
  # Batch Update Attachments (Protected)

  **Method:** `PATCH`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/attachments/batch`
  **Auth:** Required (Bearer Token)

  ## Description

  Updates common metadata fields across multiple attachments in a single request. Enforces ownership: all requested IDs must belong to the authenticated user.

  ## Request

  ### Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `ids` | `int64[]` | Yes | List of attachment IDs to update |
  | `group_id` | `int64` | No | Associated squad/group ID |
  | `expense_id` | `int64` | No | Associated expense ID |
  | `type` | `string` | No | New attachment type |
  | `is_public` | `boolean` | No | Public flag |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "message": "attachments updated successfully"
    }
  }
  ```
}
